{"id": "EUVD-2026-103007", "enisaUuid": "5c82a259-8ce0-3d4e-af3d-acfc61167c44", "description": "Arkon through 0.9.2 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in GET /api/wiki/graph that lets authenticated employees read other departments' wiki metadata by supplying a foreign slug. Attackers with only wiki:read:own_dept permission can query get_neighborhood() without scope checks to obtain page slugs, titles, types and link edges up to depth 3.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:40:04", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T14:08:21", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/arkon-wiki-graph-cross-department-idor", "https://github.com/nduckmink/arkon/blob/v0.9.2/app/routers/wiki.py#L621-L633", "https://github.com/nduckmink/arkon/blob/v0.9.2/app/services/wiki_service.py#L200-L257", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/arkon-through-0.9.2-missing-authorization-via-wiki-graph-neighborhood-api"], "aliases": ["GHSA-h23m-p5hh-g2pm", "CVE-2026-111715"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8573380e-4b17-38d0-b115-68c1960d6c26", "product": {"name": "arkon", "vendor": {"name": "nduckmink"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.9.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "13deca9e-c743-3089-8342-4a946aca49f7", "vendor": {"name": "nduckmink"}}], "isExploited": false}